<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz president to visit U.S. from July 8-15.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz president to visit U.S. from July 8-15.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyz President Askar Akayev will visit the United States from July 8-15, presidential spokesman Kanybek Imanaliyev said on Monday.</p>
<p>He told a news briefing that apart from talks with U.S. officials Akayev is expected to sign a credit agreement with the U.S. Export-Import Bank.</p>
<p>He gave no details.</p>
</text>
